# Keeps the Docker build context small and builds fast. Applies when the
# build context is the repo root — the root Dockerfile / Render / Railway
# path. None of these are COPY'd into the image — they're runtime-
# generated, dev-only, or source material for offline scripts.
.git
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
astro-engine/data/
astro-engine/marketing/videos/
astro-engine/marketing/vo/
astro-engine/samples/
astro-engine/backend/vendor/
astro-engine/tools/
astro-engine/assets/
